# CSS

- Layout chrome: `dashboard-layout.css`. Shared page/card/table/badge: `admin.styles.css`.
- Feature styles: `Content/CSS/{module}.styles.css` (example: `inventory.styles.css`).
- Bootstrap 3 for grid/forms. Custom CSS for the admin shell (sidebar, KPIs, cards).
- Reuse `.page-header-section`, `.admin-card`, `.stat-card`, `.status-badge`.
- No Dabang clone (visitor waves, world map, sales widgets).
